The present calculations for the D6075 establish an appropriate value for the inflow time constant: τ = 14 revs (2.4 sec), for CT = 0.005 and λh = 0.05. The dimensional time constant should scale as t ~ R/vh. Hence the general result is τrev = 0.7/λh. For the V-22 then, with CT = 0.013 and λh = 0.08, the time constant value is τ = 9 revs (1.3 sec).
